  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nigeria Disability Inclusion Pilot workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This workshop is to facilitated the needed and training from CBM to CAFOD Nigeria and its partners to learn about disability inclusion in programming. 
The anticipated outcome is increased knowledge, technical skills and confidence of CWSI to embed disability inclusion into its project design, implementation and reporting (including data collection and analysis). The emphasis here is learning by doing. 12 months will provide the partner enough time to work through a simplified project cycle practically and capture relevant learning. There will opportunity to receive targeted mentoring from CBM and the OPD and for CAFOD staff to accompany the process and simultaneously learn. The partner will also have opportunity to shadow and have exchange visits with CBM and the OPD.</narrative>
  </description>
